<h1>Pike Tutorial</h1>

<p>Version 1.0 of this tutorial was completed by Thomas Padron-McCarthy on
February 29, 2000 (with thanks to Fredrik Hübinette, who wrote the original
tutorial), and covered Pike 7.0. Maintenance since then has been in the hands
of Johan Sundström and the rest of the <a href="/development/team/">pike
development team</a>, and we would hope that you too would want to
participate, helping out and contributing updates, pointing out what could be
improved upon, and how. Send us a mail at <mail>manual@pike.ida.liu.se</mail>
and join in!</p>

